    "long_instructions": "## Create an Array\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Create an array called `favoritesArray` and add at least 3 related items.\r\n\r\n2. Prompt AI to generate 3-5 more items and add them to your `favoritesArray` (do not replace your original items).\r\n\r\n3. **Check the AI’s Work:** Look at your updated array:\r\n\t* Do all items match your category?\r\n\t* Are any repeated or unrelated?\r\n",
